    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754790/extras/cb56fd2d3700b239a3faec1d4eedd1c0.avif?t=1733137208\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754790/extras/595b6d44058cf65776e62d739da17007.avif?t=1733137208\" /></div><br>Become the loyal Pharaoh\u2019s adviser and help him to restore peace and prosperity in the golden cities of Egypt. Construct houses re-establish production, collect taxes and gather materials, set up production and trade, and fight crocodiles and wicked cobras. Restore Egypt to its days of glory!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754790/extras/655253165d6364c944cdf7e1c87a2b52.avif?t=1733137208\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> HELP the people of ancient Egypt to restore their kingdom in this exciting time management adventure game!<br></li><li> EXPLORE the magnificent era of our history<br></li><li> 44 EXCITING levels to master and hundreds of quests<br></li><li> FIGHT dangerous cobras, scorpions, crocodiles and more!<br></li><li> EARN achievements along the way<br></li><li> MEET friends from outer space<br></li><li> 2 difficulty modes: relaxed and adventure<br></li><li> Step-by-step tutorials for beginners<ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754790/extras/cb56fd2d3700b239a3faec1d4eedd1c0.avif?t=1733137208\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754790/extras/595b6d44058cf65776e62d739da17007.avif?t=1733137208\" /></div><br>Become the loyal Pharaoh\u2019s adviser and help him to restore peace and prosperity in the golden cities of Egypt. Construct houses re-establish production, collect taxes and gather materials, set up production and trade, and fight crocodiles and wicked cobras. Restore Egypt to its days of glory!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1754790/extras/655253165d6364c944cdf7e1c87a2b52.avif?t=1733137208\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> HELP the people of ancient Egypt to restore their kingdom in this exciting time management adventure game!<br></li><li> EXPLORE the magnificent era of our history<br></li><li> 44 EXCITING levels to master and hundreds of quests<br></li><li> FIGHT dangerous cobras, scorpions, crocodiles and more!<br></li><li> EARN achievements along the way<br></li><li> MEET friends from outer space<br></li><li> 2 difficulty modes: relaxed and adventure<br></li><li> Step-by-step tutorials for beginners<ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
